<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR1d0052-la-0b74d5d1" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Sinarum Scientia Politico-Moralis a P. Prospero Intorcetta in lucem edita </title><editor role="translator">Intorcetta</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>Sinarum Scientia Politico-Moralis a P. Prospero Intorcetta in lucem edita </title>Canton, 1667, Paris, 1679</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR1d0052"><title xml:lang="och">禮記(正文)</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="la">Latin</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-04-30T23:19:31.906+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-05T21:59:22.951+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-05T21:59:42.363+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-05T22:01:43.465+09:00</date> by CH</creation><creation resp="#CH">Header modified: <date>2026-05-05T22:02:01.505+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR1d0052-start"><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.3-h" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:12:31.735+09:00">Sententiae Sinicae . Liber inter Confvcii libros secundus</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:07:13.072+09:00">Quod coelo inditum est dicitur natura rationalis:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:04:36.701+09:00">quod conformtur huic naturae, dicitur regula;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:05:19.684+09:00">restaurare hanc regulam dicitur institutio.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:06:31.712+09:00">Regula haec </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:06:36.568+09:00">non potest momento temporis abesse;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:06:58.77+09:00">si posset abesse; non esset regula.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T23:55:50.037+09:00">Hac de causa perfectus vir attendit et invigilat in his etiam quae non videntur:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:08:13.53+09:00">timet ac pauet in his etiam quae non audiuntur.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:09:48.746+09:00">non apparent quia recondita:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-05T22:10:08.659+09:00">non sunt manifesta, quia subtilia.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:22:05.568+09:00">Ideò perfectus vir inuigilat sui secreto.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:23:57.157+09:00">Gaudium, ira, tristitia, hilaritas, priusquam pullulent, </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:24:10.9+09:00">dicuntur medium seu natura indifferens:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:24:54.474+09:00">ubi pullularint et omnia attigerint rectam mensuram; </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:25:18.384+09:00">dicuntur concordia.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:27:04.251+09:00">medium</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:27:43.183+09:00">est orbis magnum fundamentum:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:32:55.009+09:00">concordia </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:33:05.341+09:00">est orbis universalis regula.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:36:35.95+09:00">Perfectius medio et concordia, </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#twharbsmeier" modified="2026-05-27T01:36:55.686+09:00">coeli ac terrae status quietus, et omnium rerum propagatio existit.</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>